  "details": "- System Info\nUnity Version : Unity2019.4.28f1\nSDK Version : U2019-VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.07.23.18.12_Public\nVRChat Client Build : 1118\n\n- Overview\nThe terrain of my world in below link is broken in build1118.\nIt was not broken in build1116.\nAlso, there is no problem on Unity scene.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_151ad3f0-b39e-438f-98c2-978ebecf0317\n\n- Steps to reproduce\n  ・Launch the world in the link above with build1118.\n\n- What I tried\n  ・Terrain was broken in build1118 in the world uploaded with 2021.07.15.13.46 SDK.\n  ・Terrain was also broken in build1118 in the world uploaded with 2021.07.23.18.12 SDK.\n  ・ Client cache clear\n\n- Remark and detail\nWhen build1116 was released, the Terrain for this world created in unity2018 was broken as well as this report.\nTherefore, I migrated the project from unity2018 to unity2019.4.28f1 and uploaded it again with 2021.07.15.13.46SDK, and confirmed that the Terrain was fixed in the open beta (build1116).\nHowever, I confirmed that Terrain was broken again in build1118. I installed the latest betaSDK as mentioned in \"System Info\" and uploaded it again, but there was no improvement.",
